### Create a purchase
POST http://localhost:5293/api/purchases
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productName": "PS5",
  "retailer": "Game",
  "purchaseDate": "2026-10-31T00:00:00",
  "purchasePrice": 23000.99,
  "warrantyDurationMonths": 30
}

### Update a purchase
PUT http://localhost:5293/api/purchases/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productName": "Samsung Galaxy S25 Ultra",
  "retailer": "Samsung Online Store",
  "purchaseDate": "2026-11-08T00:00:00",
  "purchasePrice": 20000.99,
  "warrantyDurationMonths": 36
}


